---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '在中国付款失败怎么办';
const description = '外国游客在中国付款失败的常见原因，以及一步步排查方法，教你搞定扫二维码付款不成功的问题。';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/payment/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        返回支付指南
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">💳 支付</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        在中国付款失败怎么办
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">别慌——大部分付款失败都好解决。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新：2026 年 6 月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读时长：4 分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-50 to-orange-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-4">🎯 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-red-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>外国人付款失败挺常见的。</strong>多半是日限额到了、银行风控拦截、或者网络问题。试试换现金、换个应用、或者连 WiFi。都不行的话，等几个小时再试一次。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        这事儿你迟早会遇到。在店里扫了二维码，应用转了几圈——报错，付款失败。
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        别慌。外国人在中国遇到付款失败很常见，大部分情况解决起来很简单。
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🔍</span> 为什么会失败
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">1. 日限额用完了</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">支付宝和微信支付都有每日消费限额。买太多就可能超了。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>解决：</strong>等第二天——日限额会自动重置。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">2. 银行拦截了这笔交易</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">你的银行看到一笔来自中国的消费，以为被盗刷了。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>解决：</strong>看手机通知——银行通常会发短信确认是否是你本人。确认后再试一次。出行前通知银行能避免这个问题。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">3. 网络问题</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">VPN 可能断了，或者商家的网络太慢。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>解决：</strong>检查 VPN，开关飞行模式，或者让商家重试一次。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">4. 商家不收境外卡</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">一些小商家绑定的收款账户只支持中国银行卡。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>解决：</strong>用现金，或者问能不能微信支付（有时支付宝不行但微信可以）。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">✅</span> 快速排查清单
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ol class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <div><strong>换个应用</strong>——支付宝不行就试微信支付（反过来也行）</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            <div><strong>用现金</strong>——随身带 500–1000 元小额纸币备用</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            <div><strong>连 WiFi</strong>——问商家要 WiFi 密码；有时手机流量是问题所在</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
            <div><strong>重启应用</strong>——关掉支付宝或微信重新打开</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">5</span>
            <div><strong>等一会儿再试</strong>——有些问题过几分钟自己就好了</div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关攻略</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">在中国怎么付钱</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">完整支付指南</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">外国人如何开通支付宝</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">一步步设置教程</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">参考来源</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://www.alipayplus.com/consumer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">支付宝 - 用户中心</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://cs.help.wechat.com/hc/en-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">微信 - 帮助中心</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>

<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "HowTo", "name": "在中国付款失败怎么办", "step": [{"@type": "HowToStep", "name": "换个应用", "text": "1 换个应用 ——支付宝不行就试微信支付（反过来也行）"}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "name": "用现金", "text": "2 用现金 ——随身带 500–1000 元小额纸币备用"}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "name": "连 WiFi", "text": "3 连 WiFi ——问商家要 WiFi 密码；有时手机流量是问题所在"}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "name": "重启应用", "text": "4 重启应用 ——关掉支付宝或微信重新打开"}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "name": "等一会儿再试", "text": "5 等一会儿再试 ——有些问题过几分钟自己就好了"}]}</script>
</Layout>